    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/fa64fb650bb741c3ccee9f92ffec583d.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/f1a039457737891ae0912af2043ffac1.poster.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/f1a039457737891ae0912af2043ffac1.webm?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/f1a039457737891ae0912af2043ffac1.mp4?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Destroy slimes with any of the weapons available to you - A turret, minigun, lasers, grenades, even a multi-turret! Some slimes are tougher than others, some even shoot back at you. Blow up enough of them, and you'll eventually level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/a95462e526d59e44d985d11f3a6e35c9.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/153ad8e6caef019f1906ad29d61251a4.poster.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/153ad8e6caef019f1906ad29d61251a4.webm?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/153ad8e6caef019f1906ad29d61251a4.mp4?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every slime you kill drops experience orbs - Pick up enough to level up and get an upgrade of your choosing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/7b7160210120353e58c2e998da21d13e.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/ea63b729eb9526fb1fad87d8030c2df0.poster.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/ea63b729eb9526fb1fad87d8030c2df0.webm?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/ea63b729eb9526fb1fad87d8030c2df0.mp4?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more upgrades you get, the faster you kill slimes &gt; The faster you kill slimes, the more you level up &gt; The more you level up the more upgrades you get. It's a vicious cycle that eventually leads to total mayhem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just be careful not to die in the process...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/fa64fb650bb741c3ccee9f92ffec583d.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/f1a039457737891ae0912af2043ffac1.poster.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/f1a039457737891ae0912af2043ffac1.webm?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/f1a039457737891ae0912af2043ffac1.mp4?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Destroy slimes with any of the weapons available to you - A turret, minigun, lasers, grenades, even a multi-turret! Some slimes are tougher than others, some even shoot back at you. Blow up enough of them, and you'll eventually level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/a95462e526d59e44d985d11f3a6e35c9.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/153ad8e6caef019f1906ad29d61251a4.poster.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/153ad8e6caef019f1906ad29d61251a4.webm?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/153ad8e6caef019f1906ad29d61251a4.mp4?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every slime you kill drops experience orbs - Pick up enough to level up and get an upgrade of your choosing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/7b7160210120353e58c2e998da21d13e.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/ea63b729eb9526fb1fad87d8030c2df0.poster.avif?t=1748282351\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/ea63b729eb9526fb1fad87d8030c2df0.webm?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635450/extras/ea63b729eb9526fb1fad87d8030c2df0.mp4?t=1748282351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more upgrades you get, the faster you kill slimes &gt; The faster you kill slimes, the more you level up &gt; The more you level up the more upgrades you get. It's a vicious cycle that eventually leads to total mayhem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just be careful not to die in the process...</p>",
